      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 3. Restriction on agency other than personal service funding commitments. No mayoral agency shall commit funds in excess of $50,000 for OTPS except as set forth in this section. Any such commitment shall require approval of an OTPS Review Committee, which shall consist of representatives of the Office of Management and Budget, the Office of Operations and the Mayor's Office of Contracts. Such committee may approve such commitment only upon written submission by the agency proposing such commitment and a determination by such committee that such proposed commitment meets the criteria set forth in paragraphs (a) through (e) of Section 2 of this Order. Such committee shall consult with the Office of the Corporation Counsel as necessary in considering agency submissions pursuant to this section.",
